## Available Tools

| Tool | Description |
|------|-------------|
| calculator | Evaluate mathematical expressions |
| get_current_time | Get current date/time in ISO format |
| search_documents | Search through documents |
| echo | Echo back input (for testing) |

## MCP Protocol

This server implements the MCP specification:

- **Transport**: stdio (JSON-RPC over stdin/stdout)
- **Protocol Version**: 2024-11-05
- **Capabilities**: Tool listing and execution

### Example MCP Request

```json
{{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "tools/call", "params": {{"name": "calculator", "arguments": {{"expression": "2 + 3"}}}}}}
```

## Configuration

All configuration is done via environment variables. See `.env.example`.

